\"item\": \"accuracyPenaltyApplies\", \"flag\": true, \"note\": \"court: liable 'to the extent the understatement ... is substantial', left to Rule 155; approval yes, no reasonable cause. Lean value is on partial facts (Principal Life, credits, as-filed deduction omitted).\"}]}"
